    "[ New ] clears the screen for the next conversation. It asks once first.\n\nHold on any words to copy them.\n\nIf it goes quiet for a while, captions pause on their own.\n\nYou can replay this in Settings." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "[ New ] clears the screen for the next conversation. It asks once first.\n\nHold on any words to copy them.\n\nIf it goes quiet for a while, captions pause on their own.\n\nYou can replay this in Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
